## Message action catalog (extension → background)

| action | Transport | Notes |
|--------|-----------|--------|
| `playAlbum` | REST search + replaceAndPlay | `{ artist, album }` |
| `playTrack` | REST search + replaceAndPlay | `{ artist, album, track }` |
| `getSimilarAlbums` | REST pluginEndpoint | Returns full JSON from Volumio |
| `getRecentlyAddedAlbums` | REST pluginEndpoint | Returns full JSON from Volumio |
| `getQueuePopularity` | REST getQueue + POST `album_popularity` | One call per album. Each queue item gets `popularity` or `null`. Always `{ success: true }` |
| `getBrowsePopularity` | REST POST `album_popularity` | `{ groups: [{ artist, album, titles }] }` → `{ groups: [{ scores }] }` aligned with `titles`. Misses are `null` |
| `getAlbumArt` | REST proxy | `{ url }` → data URL or null |
| `play` | REST commands | Requires WS open in reference impl (see edge case 1) |
| `next`, `prev` | REST commands | Same |
| `pause` | WebSocket | |
| `setVolume` | WebSocket | `{ value: 0–100 }` |
| `seek` | WebSocket | `{ value: seconds }` |

