## Album Tools plugin (server side)

Category: `user_interface`. REST registration in plugin `onStart` only.

Install summary: copy to `~/volumio-plugins-sources/album_tools`, `npm install`, on fresh Volumio `mkdir -p /data/plugins/user_interface/album_tools`, `volumio plugin refresh`, `volumio vrestart`, enable plugin, configure Last.fm API key.

See repo `volumio_plugins/user_interface/album_tools/README.md` for full steps.

---

## Security / permissions

Browser extension needs `host_permissions` for `http://*/*` (local Volumio is HTTP). Only talk to configured IP/ports; validate album-art URLs against base URL.

---

## Testing checklist

- [ ] WS connects; overlay updates on track change without refresh
- [ ] playAlbum from external site with API port 3000 and with UI on port 80
- [ ] similar_albums with local track playing; error with nothing playing
- [ ] recently_added with plugin enabled
- [ ] Popularity bars on `/queue` and on an open album at `/browse`; columns stay aligned on the widest and the missing score
- [ ] `album_popularity` with `titles` scores a library name that differs from Last.fm's album listing ("4 Degrees")
- [ ] Plugin switch off, and album under the listener minimum, draw no bars and do not error in the extension list
- [ ] pause/seek/volume with WS connected; behavior when WS disconnected
- [ ] Media Session: lid close does not stop Volumio playback
- [ ] Plugin disabled → pluginEndpoint error surfaced in UI
